    "description": "\"\ud83c\udfb5 Voice Changer and voice effects app - Transform Your Voice with funny sound effect.\r\n\r\nWelcome to the funny voice changer app! This sounds effects app will turn your voice into a unique and entertaining musical masterpiece. Record your voice, apply effects, and share them with your friends. With various sound effects of voice changer sound effects app, it's easier to apply amazing voice effects without any charge. \r\n\r\nAre you ready to explore distinctive voice change sound effects and create imaginative audio recordings with this audio editor app? \r\n\r\nThe main functions in voice changer with effects app: \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa4 Voice recorder and voice changer: \r\n- Tap to record voice with high quality and then, change your voice\r\n- The voice audio changer app lets you alter your voice in various ways. Convert voices into some funny sounds\r\n- Use app to modify audio sound, change your voice\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc1 Import audio files and apply sound effects\r\n- Easily import sound or audio recording on your phone to edit audio effects\r\n- Unlimited audio file duration for applying sound effects\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 Voice Effects for sound recording:\r\n- Infuse creativity into your audio recordings by applying unique sound effects. You can generate effects like helium sound, robot, monster, and many more. \r\n- Upload voice recording file to change the sound with amazing effects\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude04 Meme sound effects for funny funny voice changer:\r\n- Monster\r\n- Helium\r\n- Squirrel\r\n- Villain\r\n- Zombie\r\n- Drunk\r\nAnd a wide range of background noise for you to apply on recording audio\r\n\r\nThe voice changer voice effects app prides itself on its user-friendly interface that caters to users of all ages. Start using the voice recorder audio editor app now to generate new and remarkably unique sounds in a fun and simple manner. \r\n\r\nWhy should you choose our voice changer editor app?\r\n- Voice effects studio with various sound effects to select\r\n- Support many format of audio file\r\n- User friendly interface and easy to use\r\n- Manage audio after changer voice. Save and share quickly\r\n\r\nThe voice filter app is constantly updated. Therefore, let us know below if you have any questions about the voice changers app.\r\nIf you have any question about our sound effects app, feel free to contact us at: smiteam247@gmail.com\r\nThank you!.",
